            "text": "{\n  \"claim_judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"C0000\",\n      \"unit_ids\": [\"U0000\"],\n      \"source_refs\": [\"S0/F008:F009\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"Claim C0000 misrepresents the provision at § 91.107(a)(3)(iii)(A). The summary reads like an argumentative answer to an external question ('No. The restraint system must also meet additional requirements...') and conflates the specific accompaniment condition with unrelated requirements from subsequent paragraphs ((B) labels/types and (C) operator compliance). Furthermore, the modality is left as 'uncertain' despite the clear conditional requirement ('provided that: The child is accompanied by...'), and the governing scope from paragraph (a)(3)(iii) is missing from the explicit scope fields.\",\n      \"dimensions\": {\n        \"summary\": \"error\",\n        \"actor\": \"not_applicable\",\n        \"support\": \"error\",\n        \"scope\": \"error\",\n        \"links\": \"correct\",\n        \"boundary\": \"correct\",\n        \"modality\": \"error\",\n        \"action\": \"not_applicable\",\n        \"object\": \"not_applicable\",\n        \"alternatives\": \"error\",\n        \"thresholds\": \"not_applicable\",\n        \"concepts\": \"correct\",\n        \"source_attribution\": \"not_applicable\",\n        \"effectivity\": \"not_applicable\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unit_judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"U0000\",\n      \"claim_ids\": [\"C0000\"],\n      \"status\": \"partial\",\n      \"rationale\": \"Unit U0000 defines the requirement that a child occupying an approved child restraint system must be accompanied by a parent, guardian, or designated attendant. While C0000 mentions an authorized adult accompanying the child, it garbles the requirement within extraneous rules, frames the text as conversational commentary ('No.'), and fails to establish the governing condition and normative force accurately.\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"S0/F008:F009\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}",
